# <type>(<scope>): <short summary>
#   │      │            │
#   │      │            └── Summary, present tense, no period at end, ≤72 chars
#   │      │
#   │      └── Scope (optional): api, ingestion, agent, analyser, llm, models,
#   │                            vector-store, cli, docker, docs, deps, ci
#   │
#   └── Type: feat | fix | perf | docs | chore | refactor | test | ci | build | style
#
# ─── Release impact ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   feat      → MINOR bump (new capability)
#   fix       → PATCH bump
#   perf      → PATCH bump
#   others    → no release
#
# ─── Breaking changes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   Add ! after the type/scope, or include BREAKING CHANGE: footer.
#     feat(api)!: rename /chat endpoint to /ask
#
# ─── Examples ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   feat(ingestion): add currency field to Transaction model
#   fix(agent): strip markdown fences from goal CSV LLM response
#   perf(vector-store): filter metadata before embedding search
#   chore(deps): bump langgraph to 0.3.0
#   feat(api)!: rename /chat endpoint to /ask
#
# Full policy: docs/RELEASING.md
